        <mxCell id="app" value="&lt;b&gt;example-api&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b&gt;of-load&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sample service (service-0.3) and stress service (service-0.4), each with a Helm chart and an Argo CD Application&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#687078&quot;&gt;prod01-us-east-1/app-services: example-api, of-load&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#879196;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="vpc">
