        <mxCell id="lg_facts" value="One account holds every environment and every shared service.&lt;br&gt;No AWS Organization: no OUs and no SCPs.&lt;br&gt;Human access: IAM users in one IAM group; no IAM Identity Center.&lt;br&gt;Isolation between workloads: IAM policy, VPC and Kubernetes namespace." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=4;strokeColor=#CD2264;fillColor=#FDF2F7;rounded=1;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="legend">
